    "sections": {
        "description": "The Massage Parlor Theme is designed for businesses such as spa and salon services, hair salon setups, beauty shop outlets, beauty salon spa centers, beauty salon professionals, and beauty parlour services, making it a versatile massage parlor theme, spa salon website template, wellness center design, and beauty services layout for modern service providers. It offers a structured layout to present services and business information clearly, including sections for displaying massage therapies, wellness treatments, therapists, pricing tables, testimonials, and special offers in an organized format, supporting treatments like spa massage, peeling, and other skincare and relaxation services, along with showcasing lifestyle products. The theme is responsive and mobile-friendly, ensuring consistent performance across devices, and is built with SEO-friendly practices for better visibility. It supports appointment scheduling through compatible booking tools like Bookly, enabling users to manage service bookings efficiently, and provides dedicated areas for featured services and promotions. The design focuses on clean typography, simple navigation, and customizable layouts that allow users to modify content and appearance without coding, suitable for businesses such as bsalon setups and wellness studios. Integration with Contact Form 7 facilitates customer inquiries, while WooCommerce compatibility enables the management of wellness packages and gift vouchers, making it suitable for service-based businesses that require both informational and transactional capabilities."
    },
